Kilo, Apogee Mind in RUW, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Kilo, Apogee Mind :: Whenever Kilo becomes tapped, proliferate.

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Cyclonic Rift :: Return target nonland permanent you don't control to its owner's hand.
