# Removal you can point anywhere
Swords to Plowshares :: Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.
Generous Gift :: Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.
Lux Cannon :: {T}: Put a charge counter on this artifact.

